  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Alma",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 52,
    "summary": "Ammoron succeeds Amalickiah as king of the Lamanites—Moroni, Teancum, and Lehi lead the Nephites in a victorious war against the Lamanites—The city of Mulek is retaken, and Jacob the Zoramite is slain. About 66–64 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And now, it came to pass in the twenty and sixth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi, behold, when the Lamanites awoke on the first morning of the first month, behold, they found Amalickiah was dead in his own tent; and they also saw that Teancum was ready to give them battle on that day.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 272,
            "end": 277,
            "text": "Alma 51:36."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 51:36.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 51:36",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 51,
                    "end": 51,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 36,
                        "end": 36
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:1",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And now, when the Lamanites saw this they were affrighted; and they abandoned their design in marching into the land northward, and retreated with all their army into the city of Mulek, and sought protection in their fortifications.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 179,
            "end": 184,
            "text": "Alma 51:26."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 51:26.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 51:26",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 51,
                    "end": 51,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 26,
                        "end": 26
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:2",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that the brother of Amalickiah was appointed king over the people; and his name was Ammoron; thus king Ammoron, the brother of king Amalickiah, was appointed to reign in his stead.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 36,
            "text": "Alma 48:1 (1–6); 54:5."
          },
          {
            "start": 104,
            "end": 111,
            "text": "Alma 54:1; Hel. 1:16."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 54:1; Hel. 1:16.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 54:1; Helaman 1:16",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 54,
                    "end": 54,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 1,
                        "end": 1
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "helaman",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 1,
                    "end": 1,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 16,
                        "end": 16
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:3",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that he did command that his people should maintain those cities, which they had taken by the shedding of blood; for they had not taken any cities save they had lost much blood.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:4",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And now, Teancum saw that the Lamanites were determined to maintain those cities which they had taken, and those parts of the land which they had obtained possession of; and also seeing the enormity of their number, Teancum thought it was not expedient that he should attempt to attack them in their forts.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:5",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "But he kept his men round about, as if making preparations for war; yea, and truly he was preparing to defend himself against them, by casting up walls round about and preparing places of resort.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 135,
            "end": 142,
            "text": "Alma 50:1; 53:3."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 50:1; 53:3.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 50:1; 53:3",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 50,
                    "end": 50,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 1,
                        "end": 1
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "start": 53,
                    "end": 53,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 3,
                        "end": 3
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:6",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that he kept thus preparing for war until Moroni had sent a large number of men to strengthen his army.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:7",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And Moroni also sent orders unto him that he should retain all the prisoners who fell into his hands; for as the Lamanites had taken many prisoners, that he should retain all the prisoners of the Lamanites as a ransom for those whom the Lamanites had taken.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 211,
            "end": 217,
            "text": "Alma 54:2 (1–2)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:8",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And he also sent orders unto him that he should fortify the land Bountiful, and secure the narrow pass which led into the land northward, lest the Lamanites should obtain that point and should have power to harass them on every side.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 74,
            "text": "Alma 22:29; 53:3 (3–4); 63:5; Hel. 1:23."
          },
          {
            "start": 91,
            "end": 97,
            "text": "Alma 22:32; Morm. 2:29."
          },
          {
            "start": 127,
            "end": 136,
            "text": "Alma 51:30."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 22:32; Morm. 2:29.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 22:32; Mormon 2:29",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 22,
                    "end": 22,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 32,
                        "end": 32
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "mormon",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 2,
                    "end": 2,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 29,
                        "end": 29
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "raw": "Alma 51:30.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 51:30",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 51,
                    "end": 51,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 30,
