      },
      {
        "text": "Moroni being in their course of march, therefore Jacob was determined to slay them and cut his way through to the city of Mulek. But behold, Moroni and his men were more powerful; therefore they did not give way before the Lamanites.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 34,
