        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:35",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 35
      },
      {
        "text": "And Lehi pressed upon their rear with such fury with his strong men, that the Lamanites in the rear delivered up their weapons of war; and the remainder of them, being much confused, knew not whither to go or to strike.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 36,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:36",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 36
      },
      {
        "text": "Now Moroni seeing their confusion, he said unto them: If ye will bring forth your weapons of war and deliver them up, behold we will forbear shedding your blood.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 37,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 52:37",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 37
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that when the Lamanites had heard these words, their chief captains, all those who were not slain, came forth and threw down their weapons of war at the feet of Moroni, and also commanded their men that they should do the same.",
        "footNotes": [
